<title>USA: IPO PRICING - LHS Group Inc prices at $16.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - LHS Group Inc prices at $16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			LHS Group Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $15 - $16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,800,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   Goldman Sachs &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in LHS Group was lowered to $15 to $16 from $15 to $17. The original estimate of $14 to $16 was made in February.</p>
<p>The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering was reduced to 4.8 million shares from 5.883 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
